--- thematic breaks (spec 43) ---
<hr>
<hr>
<hr>
--- atx headings (spec 62) ---
<h1>foo</h1>
<h2>foo</h2>
<h3>foo</h3>
<h4>foo</h4>
<h5>foo</h5>
<h6>foo</h6>
--- seven hashes is not a heading (spec 64) ---
<p>####### foo</p>
--- a hash needs a space (spec 65) ---
<p>#5 bolt</p>
<p>#hashtag</p>
--- fenced code (spec 89) ---
<pre><code>&lt;
 &gt;
</code></pre>
--- fenced code with an info string (spec 112) ---
<pre><code class="language-ruby">def foo(x)
  return 3
end
</code></pre>
--- paragraphs (spec 219) ---
<p>aaa</p>
<p>bbb</p>
--- atx closing sequence (spec 79) ---
<h2>foo ##</h2>
--- block quote (spec 228) ---
<blockquote>
<h1>Foo</h1>
<p>bar baz</p>
</blockquote>
--- bullet list, changing marker (spec 281) ---
<ul>
<li>foo</li>
<li>bar</li>
<li>baz</li>
</ul>
--- ordered list, changing delimiter (spec 288) ---
<ol>
<li>foo</li>
<li>bar</li>
</ol>
<p>3) baz</p>
--- code span (spec 328) ---
<code>foo</code>
--- code span, doubled backticks (spec 330) ---
<code></code> foo <code> bar </code>`
--- emphasis (spec 350) ---
<em>foo bar</em>
--- emphasis needs a left flank (spec 352) ---
a <em> foo bar</em>
--- underscore emphasis (spec 360) ---
<em>foo bar</em>
--- strong (spec 403) ---
<strong>foo bar</strong>
--- link (spec 483) ---
<a href="/uri">link</a>
--- link with a title (spec 482) ---
<a href="/uri &quot;title&quot;">link</a>
--- image (spec 571) ---
<img src="train.jpg" alt="foo">
--- image with a title (spec 568) ---
<img src="/url &quot;title&quot;" alt="foo">
--- raw html (spec 613) ---
&lt;a&gt;&lt;bab&gt;&lt;c2c&gt;
--- a fence keeps its contents literal ---
<code>**not strong**</code>

== where this renderer departs from CommonMark ==
79 atx heading: a closing ## is kept as text; the spec strips it.
228 block quote: a paragraph's lines are joined with a space, not a newline.
281 bullet list: - * and + are one list, not three; the spec starts a new list per marker.
288 ordered list: only 'n.' is a list; 'n)' is a paragraph.
330 code span: one backtick only, so a doubled fence does not span an inner backtick.
352 emphasis: no left/right flanking rules, so ' * foo bar*' still emphasises.
482 link: no title argument; the title stays part of the URL.
568 image: no title argument, as for links.
613 raw html: escaped, never passed through. A generator is not a sanitizer.
